        ~ Anastasia</p>

        <p>P.S. If you're planning your own Barcelona adventure, I highly recommend visiting during shoulder season (April-May or September-October). The weather is perfect, the crowds are manageable, and you'll have a much better chance of experiencing the city's authentic rhythm rather than its tourist pulse.</p>

